<% inv = @invoice; ws = @workspace
   money = ->(n) { number_to_currency(n) }
   meter = ->(n) { n.abs >= 1 ? number_to_currency(n) : number_to_currency(n, precision: 4) }
   billed = inv.billed_line_items
   free   = inv.unbilled_line_items
   friendly = { "Browser smoke tests" => "Automated site checks" }
   metered = inv.metered_usage_dollars
   budget_month = inv.average_list_price_dollars -%>
AGENT44 LABS: USAGE SUMMARY

Workspace: <%= ws.name %>
Period:    <%= inv.period_label %> (<%= inv.period_start.strftime("%b %-d") %> to <%= inv.period_end.strftime("%b %-d, %Y") %>)

EVERYTHING THAT RAN, METERED
<% billed.each do |li| -%>
  - <%= friendly[li["label"]] || li["label"] %>: <%= number_with_delimiter(li["calls"].to_i) %> <%= li["label"] == "Browser smoke tests" ? "runs" : "uses" %> at <%= meter.(Invoice.line_unit_dollars(li)) %> each = <%= meter.(Invoice.line_cost_dollars(li)) %>
<% end -%>
<% if billed.empty? -%>
  (no metered activity this period)
<% end -%>
  Metered total: <%= money.(metered) %>
<% if free.any? -%>

ALSO RAN FOR YOU, NOT CHARGED
<% free.each do |li| -%>
  - <%= friendly[li["label"]] || li["label"] %>: <%= number_with_delimiter(li["calls"].to_i) %> calls, no charge
<% end -%>
<% end -%>

HOW THAT PRICES OUT
Metered total <%= money.(metered) %> x <%= inv.multiplier_label %>: <%= money.(inv.usage_cost_dollars * inv.multiplier) %>
Platform fee:      <%= money.(inv.base_fee_configured_dollars) %>
List price:        <%= money.(inv.list_price_dollars) %>
Pilot credit:     -<%= money.(inv.pilot_credit_dollars) %>
You were charged:  <%= money.(inv.total_dollars) %>

PLANNING AHEAD
At this level of use, list price runs about <%= number_to_currency(budget_month, precision: 0) %> a month,
roughly <%= number_to_currency(budget_month * 12, precision: 0) %> a year. The pilot credit covers most of that
today, so this line is what to plan for if the fleet keeps running at
the same level.

Metered cost is what the work costs to run (model calls, browser time).
List price adds a <%= number_to_currency(inv.base_fee_configured_dollars, precision: 0) %> monthly platform fee and a <%= inv.multiplier_label %>x margin covering
developer time, hardware, and reserve capacity. Questions on any line,
just reply to this email.

See the live meter: https://agent44labs.com/<%= ws.slug %>/billing

